ng fritz when he decided to  move the capital of aldea to paradise a  hundred years ago and supposedly for  this reason they were given preferential  treatment by the Marlon government  unlike other ldiots who are forced to  live in internment zones the Tiber  family are considered honorary Marlon's  and they live in  mansions on big estates even stranger  than this is the fact that the timers  have controlled the power of the  Warhammer Titan this whole time but they  never once used this power to help  Marlay against an enemy state we know  how the Malayan government treats LD ins  we know how hated the LD ins are as the  so called spawn of the devil and we know  that the Marlin army has gone to extreme  lengths to use the power of the Titans  in their wars with other nations even  when that means sacrificing the lives of  innocent LD and civilians and children  so could it really be that this same  Marlon government is just so grateful to  the Tiber family for opposing the 145th  King 100 years ago that they not only  let them live freely as rich aristocrats  while every other LDN is forced to live  in internment zones but they're also  perfectly fine with the Tiber family  keeping the power of the Warhammer Titan  to themselves instead of using it to  help Marlay fight its wars with other  nations from everything we know about  the Malayan government and its treatment  of aliens this makes no sense the only  way that this whole situation would make  any sense is if the Marlon government is  not grateful to the Tiber family but  afraid of the power of the Warhammer  Titan if the Warhammer Titans power is  so strong that it poses a huge threat to  Marlay then it would make sense for the  Marlon government to negotiate a deal  with the Tiber family a deal in which  the Tiber czar allowed to live lavishly  and keep the Titan power for themselves  but what could the Warhammer Titan  secret power possibly be if it can scare  the Malayan government into making such  an uncharacteristic compromise remember  earlier when I mentioned the Thor Titan  we know that the worldö attack on titan  and the power of the titans itself is  strongly influenced by norse mythology  and of course in Norse mythology Thor is  a hammer wielding God associated with  thunder lightning and storms according  to Norse mythology Thor's hammer called  the Mjolnir is one of the most powerful  weapons in existence and it is able to  level entire mountains now we know that  every Titan shifter has a certain unique  power and ability  the Colossus Titan is huge and extremely  strong and has  to generate steam and massive explosions  the armored Titan of course has really  strong armor  ja Titan is quick and agile the female  Titan has impressive endurance and the  ability to call other Titans to her the  founding Titan can control other Titans  and so on so what if the secret power of  the Warhammer Titan is that like Thor he  has the power to generate or control  lightning or electricity we already know  that when humans transform into Titans  something very similar to flashes of  lightning appears so it would not be so  far-fetched to think that a Titan can  have the ability to generate and control  lightning and if this were the case it  would explain why the Malayan government  would fear the Warhammer Titan don't  forget that unlike the LDN some parodies  Marlay relies far more on modern  technology for everything ships blimps  trains planes and weapons and what type  of weapon could do the most damage to  this kind of technology a weapon that  harnesses the power of lightning or  electricity I'm sure you know the type  of damage that a sudden power surge can  cause to household appliances and  devices so imagine what a massive surge  of concentrated electric power could do  to Marlin technology what if the real  reason that the Marlins despite their  deep-seated hatred for the LDN race  allow the Tiber family to live as  aristocrats and keep the Warhammer 